<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios - Jan 21.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Highest/Lowest Australian P-E Ratios - Jan 21.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-01-21</dateline>
<text>
